        {
          "id": 3856560221,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I believe it should be `BlockVersionHigh > 2` as the `dissect_SAM_block()` function is also being used for legacy security requests since !26254 (see `dissect_block()` for BlockType `0x06E0 / 0x86E0` ) - unfortunately, they share the same BlockType indices as the legacy blocks.\n\nThe versions in the SCM dissector functions should probably also be updated in the same way (`0x06F0 / 0x86F0`).",
